# Repository blobs are LF. GitHub Actions' windows-latest runner otherwise
# checks text files out with CRLF, and a CRLF shebang in scripts/lib/*.mjs
# makes esbuild/Vitest fail test collection with
# "SyntaxError: Invalid or unexpected token" (D-158).
# Pin ESM scripts to LF on every platform; other extensions are intentionally
# untouched (CI run #2 proved they have no comparable failure).
*.mjs text eol=lf
